	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Fullscreen takes the display; borderless covers it\nwith a window. F11 switches to the window."/>
		<string text="What fullscreen and borderless draw at. Fullscreen\nsets the display to it; borderless scales it."/>
		<string text="The window's size: 4:3, then 16:10, 16:9 and 21:9\n(its edges can also be dragged)."/>
		<string text="Native draws at the resolution; Original draws\nthe Xbox's 640x480 and scales it up."/>
		<string text="Wait for the display between frames, so that the\npicture never tears."/>
		<string text="With V-Sync off, the most frames a second. Auto:\ntwice the display's refresh rate."/>
		<string text="Draw a frame for every display refresh, blending\nbetween the game's 30 ticks a second."/>
		<string text="In first person, turn the view the moment the\nmouse moves, not up to two ticks later."/>
		<string text="Draw the HUD from the high-res redraws; off\ndraws the game's own pictures."/>
		<string text="Draw text and titles with high-res fonts; off\ndraws the game's own."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nand SMAA are cheap; SSAA and MSAA are sharper."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nis cheap; MSAA is sharper."/>
		<string text="The size objects' shadows are drawn at: 128 as on\nthe Xbox; larger for smoother, as soft, edges."/>
		<string text="Light models for each pixel, without the facets\nof the Xbox's lighting for each vertex."/>
		<string text="Compute colours in half precision, which Mali GPUs\ndo at twice the rate; off keeps single precision."/>
		<string text="Give DXT1 and 16-bit textures to the GPU as 16-bit\ntexels, halving memory and bandwidth."/>
		<string text="How early objects switch to simpler models, as a\nfraction of the size the game switches at."/>
		<string text="The picture's resolution as a fraction of the\nscreen's: below 1.0 the GPU draws fewer pixels."/>
		<string text="Lower the resolution a step at a time while the\nGPU falls behind, and raise it when it keeps up."/>
		<string text="Show each frame at the display refresh it was\ndrawn for, holding one ready early."/>
		<string text="Draw objects' models sorted by shader, rather\nthan object by object."/>
		<string text="Decode and upload textures on a thread of their\nown, drawing with them once they are in."/>
		<string text="Translate shaders on a thread of their own,\ndrawing with them once they are in."/>
		<string text="Draw consecutive draws of the same model part\nthat differ only in constants as one."/>
		<string text="Draw consecutive quad draws of the same state\n(decals) as one."/>
		<string text="Point indexed draws' attributes at their base\nvertex, so draws from one buffer share them."/>
		<string text="Draw without the alpha test when it cannot fail,\nkeeping Mali's hidden surface removal."/>
	</strings>
